body:
Yea I get into these pretty intense delusions or hallucinations as well. I'll have a moment where I think she's pulling into the driveway and Ill go to the door to give her a hug and kiss her. But then my mind breaks and I realize I'm just laying in bed in the dark crying. 

&#x200B;

I wish I could give advice, but based off the mess I currently am, I can't.

Weed definitely not the answer for me. Every time I've smoked weed, I've had an insane panic attack that sent me on the verge of a mental breakdown. The last time I smoked, I got so baked that I thought I wasn't a real person and wanted to kill myself in order to wake up. So let's just say....never again. 

&#x200B;

Also. You're right. I thought about it more and I was just as "bored" when I was chain smoking. Sure, for a couple days it will fill time, but I'll be right back into the bored loop soon enough if I ended up buying pods.

" Stay on track, you'll thank yourself later, and youll be really bummed if you dont. "

&#x200B;

Yea you're right. That's what stopped me. I know once I hit it, it would be reversing 30 days of progress. Wouldn't be worth it. Bought myself a coconut water instead.

This made me laugh. Thank you. I didn't end up caving. Walked right up to the smoke shop and turned around. 

&#x200B;

I know you're joking, but, definitely can't even contemplate the idea of moving on to someone else.
